    {
      "id": "b3",
      "function": "explanation",
      "scene_type": "rv_cutaway",
      "spoken": "If it gets too hot, the end gas ignites by itself before the flame arrives. It burns all at once, and the pressure in the cylinder starts to oscillate. That is exactly what you hear as knock.",
